abstract: >-
  Implementation and experimental artifacts used in a research study on the evolution of the
  energy efficiency of open Large Language Models (LLMs) across successive releases, for a
  Master's Thesis titled "The Evolution of Intelligence Efficiency in Local, Open Large Language
  Models: A Controlled Empirical Study" at the University of Minho.
